$Descr User 42600 26050
encoding utf-8
Sheet 1 1
Title "DC-Modules 30 kW — AC-DC board (Vienna PFC)"
Date "2026-09-06"
Rev "D.4"
Comp "DC-Modules 30 kW - board AC-DC (lower), sheet 1 of 3"
Comment1 "Module 30 kW = two-board sandwich: sheet 1 AC-DC (lower) + sheet 2 DC-DC (upper), bolted DCP/DCN/PE studs + 16-way control harness"
Comment2 "Content: 1x Vienna PFC cell + 1x 3-ph LLC cell"
Comment3 "28 functional sections - 298 components - cross-section links are global net labels; wires are pin stubs only"
Comment4 "Every component carries MPN + LCSC fields (CLASS = buy to class spec, CUSTOM = made to drawing)"
$EndDescr
